# Production build, used by `vite build` and therefore by the Vercel deploy.
#
# The dashboard is served from admin.notefusion.studio and the API from Heroku, so calls are
# cross-origin and need an absolute base URL. That origin must also be in the API's CORS
# allow-list — see src/NoteFusion.Api/Program.cs.
#
# Not a secret: it is the same public URL the mobile app calls. Committed so a clean clone
# builds a working bundle without depending on a setting in the Vercel dashboard.
VITE_API_URL=https://notefusion-api-3c2513a1e974.herokuapp.com
